{
 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "All to catch your own girlfriend in the act of trying to get me to lower the price by parading around as a ghost!": "",
  "Ha... I get it. You're... jealous of how madly in love we are, aren't you?": "",
  "Shimazu-san... Maybe you should quit while you're ahead...": "",
  "Don't worry, Mamoru. It'll be fine.": "",
  "What do you mean, my pineapple dream?": "",
  "We just need to find a room that's really sketchy and haunted! No ghost could come between a love this strong! ": "",
  "You're sooo right, baby! Ah, life is good!": "",
  "They sure did a quick 180 on that one...": "",
  "Those two are infuriating! I hope I never have to deal with them again!": "",
  "Excuse me. Are you Shimazu-san? I'm Yagami, a detective.": "",
  "Yes. My name is Mamoru Shimazu. I've been waiting for you, Yagami-san.": "",
  "It's a pleasure. So, what can I do for you?": "",
  "You have a job for me, right?": "",
  "Yes, um...": "",
  "I need you to catch a ghost!": "",
  "...You're going to have to elaborate on that.": "",
  "Well, I'm moving into a new apartment next month...": "",
  "And I've heard it's haunted. By a ghost.": "",
  "You're basing this on a rumor?": "",
  "Yes. When I went to introduce myself to my new neighbors, they told me all about it.": "",
  "Apparently you can hear the voice of a woman crying in the room I'll be renting...": "",
  "How does a woman crying make it supernatural?": "",
  "That's not all...! A woman has been gliding through the hallway, dressed all in white with jet black hair...": "",
  "The neighbor got scared, and that's when they discovered no such woman had lived there recently!": "",
  "Okay, I guess I am getting a little creeped out.": "",
  "But the landlord is supposed to notify you if there've been any... incidents.": "",
  "And they didn't say anything of the sort.": "",
  "My girlfriend and I are actually planning on moving in together into this apartment.": "",
  "We were in a long-distance relationship, but then she quit her job, and took a chance on moving here.": "",
  "We even picked it out together! It's a little pricey, but it was perfect otherwise...": "",
  "This is her! Isn't she a beauty? Her name is Yukako.": "",
  "Yeah, I guess you wouldn't want to build a relationship in a haunted apartment.": "",
  "Huh? Yes we do.": "",
  "If we can prove there was some kind of tragic accident that happened there, we can negotiate the price down, right?": "",
  "W-Wait, you're okay with the ghost, as long the price is right? What about your girlfriend, man?": "",
  "Haha! Don't worry, she's oblivious. She couldn't sense a ghost if it sneezed on her!": "",
  "I-I see... Hmm. I'm not sure that's the problem...": "",
  "Anyway, how exactly do I fit into this?": "",
  "I want you to investigate if the apartment is haunted or not.": "",
  "...Oookay. I'll do my best? I'm gonna charge 80,000 on this one. Ghosts are extra.": "",
  "No problem! I look forward to the results!": "",
  "Tell you what, let me call the landlord and arrange for you to stay the night.": "",
  "Huh? Stay the night?": "",
  "Of course. A ghost's not going to appear if you aren't in the room at night, guy.": "",
  "R-Right... I guess I'll give it a try.": "",
  "Shut and locked. I don't think anyone could enter through these windows.": "",
  "Hm? This window won't open... Nobody's getting in from here.": "",
  "O-Oh, right now!? N-No, it's no problem at all!": "",
  "Honey! Who are you...*hic* talking to!? How long you gonna be on the phooooone?": "",
  "Don't worry sweetie, I'll just be a second.": "",
  "(I make it a point not to get too close to drunks, and that lady... is plastered.)": "",
  "Hey youuuu!": "",
  "Eh? Me?": "",
  "Yes, you with the dumb face! C'mere and take a load off!": "",
  "What? Why would I...": "",
  "I said, have a seat! How long you gonna make me drink alone!?": "",
  "But I'm...": "",
  "Don't keep your wife waiting... on her *hic* birthday...": "",
  "(Shit. This is what I get for thinking about keeping my distance.)": "",
  "(How many has she had, anyway?)": "",
  "Okay... Did you need anything? Do I know you?": "",
  "Stop with the nonsense! I'm yer wife! And you don't keep your wife waiting on her birthdaaaaaaay!": "",
  "My... wife?": "",
  "That's me! I'm sweet, I'm petite, and I'm... Naoko!": "",
  "But we're not marr...": "",
  "(How did she jump to the conclusion that I'm her husband!?)": "",
  "Sorry, I have to use the restroom real quick!": "",
  "Eh!? Hold your horses, Tatsuro!": "",
  "Hey, man. Aren't you that drunk lady's husband?": "",
  "Yeah... Sorry. I had to hide for a second.": "",
  "What the hell is going on?": "",
  "I'm just as shocked as you are, buddy. Looks like she thinks you're me.": "",
  "If she's so drunk she could mistake me for her husband, that's a problem...": "",
  "Oh, I agree. She's both wasted and near-sighted, and that is a dangerous combination.": "",
  "She's got her make-up done to the nines and no glasses, so she's blind as a bat right now.": "",
  "Why is she drinking so heavily, then?": "",
  "Well... You may have heard her ranting, but... It's her birthday today.": "",
  "The thing is, my work keeps calling, so I've been on the phone this whole time...": "",
  "She's kinda pissed about it.": "",
  "Within reason, I guess. What do you do, anyway?": "",
  "Can't you tell from looking at me? I'm an aircraft pilot.": "",
  "My wife and I work for the same airline.": "",
  "Oh... I thought you might have been cosplaying.": "",
  "It's... not actually my day off... I'm on standby. Which means I'm supposed to be waiting at home...": "",
  "But now another pilot has called out sick, and I have to go in! There's a plane full of people who need me!": "",
  "So what does your airline want with you on your day off?": "",
  "Hoooooney!? Did you fall in!?": "",
  "Nope. Not ever.": "",
  "Right... And I take it you're not supposed to go out to dinner while you're on standby?": "",
  "But my wife's birthday slipped my mind! What else was I supposed to do!?": "",
  "Yeah... She's getting pretty belligerent, huh?": "",
  "My travel schedule is bad enough... But if I break it to her that I forgot her birthday too, my marriage is over!": "",
  "(They let an irresponsible guy like this fly planes? Scary.)": "",
  "I was trying to find a way out of this mess when you showed up! Not sure why you sat with her, but I'm glad you did!": "",
  "Your voice is the same register as mine... And if you were to wear my uniform...": "",
  "Well, it sounds like you're going to have bite the bullet and tell your wife you're going in to work.": "",
  "Honey! I can seeeee you! Come have a seat!": "",
  "...I don't like where this is going.": "",
  "Whoa, whoa, whoa! Back it up! Any way you slice it, switching places with you is crazy!": "",
  "U-Um... Hey... sweetie... Sorry I took so long.": "",
  "Hmmmmm?": "",
  "Hmmm... HMMM... Now that I look closer...": "",
  "(Uh oh, is this over before it began!?)": "",
  "Have you gotten more... handsome lately?": "",
  "Oh! You really think so? Ha ha... Ha...": "",
  "Sooooo... Who was that on the phone, honey? *hic*": "",
  "Oh yes. That.": "",
  "It was my father.": "",
  "Whaaat!? Then whose funeral were we at last year?": "",
  "Oh, wow!": "",
  "Y-Yeah, that was him! Totally dead! He called using the, uh, heavenly hotline!": "",
  "The heavenly hotline!? My word... Technology has gotten so... *hic* good these days.": "",
  "(Just how drunk is she...?)": "",
  "(I better give that cheat sheet another look before I really screw something up...)": "",
  "It was my little brother.": "",
  "Ehhh? Since when do you have a little brother?": "",
  "Oh! Do I not?": "",
  "No, you don't! Not one I've ever met! You feeling okay, honey?": "",
  "Sorry, I guess the, uh, alcohol is getting to me...": "",
  "Well pull yourself... together! *hic!* Who's gonna take care of me if you're pickled too!?": "",
  "It was the captain.": "",
  "Hmph. The captain? He <font_kind=yakuza_italic>would</font_kind> call!": "",
  "Oh no, it was fine. He just, uh... butt dialed me.": "",
  "Is that sooooo? Ooooor could it have been...": "",
  "That woman!": "",
  "W-Woman? What woman?": "",
  "Don't you play dumb with me!": "",
  "I saw you...!": "",
  "You were havin' a fun little shopping spree with a flight attendant yesterday! A real young piece of ass!": "",
  "I-I was!?": "",
  "You're a terrible husband! A terrible man! Waahhh!": "",
  "What a deplorable man.": "",
  "Scum, I'd say.": "",
  "(I'm at dinner with a drunk woman who's not my wife... And I'm apparently cheating on her... Cool.)": "",
  "N-Now now, sweetie... Let's not make a scene...": "",
  "Ughhh... I've made terrible life choices.": "",
  "*hic* All men... should be blasted to the moon. *hic*": "",
  "(At least she's calming down.)": "",
  "(Oh, thank god!)": "",
  "Yagami-kun? Who is this? And what's with the outfit? Are you cosplaying as a pilot?": "",
  "M-Mafuyu!": "",
  "Huh? \"Honey?\"": "",
  "\"Yagami-kun?\" This woman a friend of yours, honey?": "",
  "H-Husband? Yagami-kun, something you want to tell me?": "",
  "Yeah, about this...": "",
  "Wh-What business do you have with my husband!? You another one of his hussies!?": "",
  "U-Umm...": "",
  "Honey! Let's hear it! Explain this to me right now, you jerk!": "",
  "(Should I signal to Mafuyu that I'm undercover? Or would Naoko catch on? She probably would...)": "",
  "(What should I say Mafuyu is to me?)": "",
  "She's... my stalker.": "",
  "Y-Yagami-kun... Are you...": "",
  "Whatever you're doing right now, Yagami-kun... I'm lost.": "",
  "No, no, no! I'm just messing around!": "",
  "Oh. I... am?": "",
  "So, who is she, then?": "",
  "She's my ex.": "",
  "Uh... huh.": "",
  "Wait. N-No, I uh...": "",
  "I'm soooo confused right now! What's going on!?": "",
  "N-No, this lady is confused...": "",
  "She's made a mistake. I'm not Yagami.": "",
  "M-Ma'am! Can't you see we're in the middle of a meal here? Now would you please leave us be until <font_kind=yakuza_italic>later</font_kind>?": "",
  "(Mafuyu, tell me you got that...!)": "",
  "I see. If that's how you're going to act, so be it!": "",
  "...She didn't get it.": "",
  "Hahahaha! She's drunker than you!": "",
  "...I want a divorce.": "",
  "That woman from earlier... She's your side piece, isn't she!? That's who you were seeing, right!?": "",
  "N-No, she's not!": "",
  "I bet she's a new flight attendant!": "",
  "W-Wait a minute! I'll explain everything!": "",
  "I'm going home!": "",
  "(I need something to fix this... <font_kind=yakuza_italic>Anything</font_kind>...)": "",
  "(This logo looks familiar. It's...)": "",
  "(It's a recent date and time...)": "",
  "(She mentioned seeing him shopping with a flight attendant, so it's possible that...)": "",
  "...I can prove I'm not having an affair, Naoko.": "",
  "I'd like you to look at this.": "",
  "This proves I'm not in an affair, doesn't it?": "",
  "Explain what!?": "",
  "(Oh... Maybe I've got that wrong.)": "",
  "R-Right, let me show you something that'll make this easier to grasp...": "",
  "(...Wait. Showing her that right now wouldn't prove her husband isn't having an affair.)": "",
  "(I need something that'll prove Tatsuro-san has an alibi for when she thinks she saw him with a flight attendant.)": "",
  "It does? I'm not so sure, buster.": "",
  "(What was he actually doing with the flight attendant... I must have something that proves it.)": "",
  "True... But what does that prove?": "",
  "This looks like scratch paper, but it's actually a receipt.": "",
  "Yeah, it's a luxury store! You're spending our hard-earned money to get in her pants!?": "",
  "See the date? That's the day you saw me shopping with that girl.": "",
  "Don't you see? Here's the store we shopped at.": "",
  "R-Really?": "",
  "Here. Happy birthday.": "",
  "You're the only one I've ever loved! And the only one I'll love until I die!": "",
  "Oh. Crap... I think I'm...": "",
  "The truth is... I needed a lady's opinion on what kind of present to get you.": "",
  "You got me a birthday present? Oh honey... How many years has it been since you've done that?": "",
  "Ah! N-Naoko!": "",
  "Huh!? Why do I suddenly have two husbands!?": "",
  "Yagami-san, thank you so much. You really went the extra mile for a complete stranger.": "",
  "I don't really know what the ladies are into these days, so...": "",
  "Oh... no...": "",
  "I'm sorry. I wanted it to be a surprise...": "",
  "Yeah, I plan on it. I've been putting my work above my marriage, and I see that now.": "",
  "I don't know, actually. But I think it means our love is real.": "",
  "But thanks to you, I think my wife's birthday turned into a great anniversary for us.": "",
  "Yes! Tonight I will make it up to her! You know. Thanks again!": "",
  "I think that might have been a bit too much to handle...": "",
  "Wow. She's fast asleep.": "",
  "Er, no, captain! I wasn't calling you sweetie!": "",
  "I mean, yes, of course I'm at home! I was talking to my... cat! I'll head over right away.": "",
  "How dareee you spend your wife's birthday... on the phone! *hic*": "",
  "Oh, waiter! Another glass of the good stuff, and make it snappy!": "",
  "Uh, no! That's not the voice of a drunk woman! The TV is on! And it's loud! I'm totally at home right now.": "",
  "Well, I'm going to ask anyway...": "",
  "Will you please take my place and have dinner with my wife!?": "",
  "Would you prefer to fly a plane for me instead?": "",
  "Okay, that's next level stupid!": "",
  "S-See! She's calling you! I'm sure you can handle a drunk woman until she passes out!": "",
  "Yes, come on, let's just hurry up and exchange our contact info.": "",
  "Here! It's a cheatsheet! It's my profile and a few important details about me!": "",
  "And here, my license and a few other important knickknacks. ": "",
  "Is this really necessary...": "",
  "The devil is in the details in these situations, my friend.": "",
  "Okay, I'm gonna stop by my house to get the spare uniform so you can have this one!": "",
  "Wow! I would trust you to fly a plane just by looking at you!": "",
  "...That's a bad call.": "",
  "All right, I've gotta get to work! Good luck!": "",
  "Whoa, wait!": "",
  "Shit. This is really happening, isn't it.": "",
  "(Here goes... But I better study this cheat sheet real quick.)": "",
  "Huh? Yagami-kun?": "",
  "It's true, my love!": "",
  "Tatsuro-san... Thank you...": "",
  "It was... interesting. But I hope you'll talk it out more when she wakes up.": "",
  "Glad to hear it. I wish you and Naoko a long happiness, Tatsuro-san.": "",
  "Oh crap. I forgot about Mafuyu.": "",
  "(Now I'm the one in hot water... I better message her.)": "",
  "(Wait, I need to be entertaining Tatsuro-san's wife. Better check the notes he gave me.)": "",
  "(Whoops, that's not right. I need to use the pilot outfit.)": "",
  "(I should give that cheat sheet a once over while I'm at it, too.)": "",
  "Hello? I'm Kotaro Hyuga, the guy who put in the request. Might even know me as \"Hinata.\"": "",
  "Oh, yeah, thanks for coming. Please, take a seat.": "",
  "So, your request said something about a setup?": "",
  "Yeah, that's right... Ergh...": "",
  "This is tough...": "",
  "Take your time.": "",
  "God...": "",
  "God DAMMMMIT!": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Oh, wow!": "โอ้ ว้าว!",
  "R-Really?": "จ-จริงเหรอ?",
  "Take your time.": "ค่อยๆ ไปก็ได้"
 }
}
